      "google_reviews_json": "{\"place_id\":\"ChIJ54i8r7Yt3UcRwfv6i1x38wA\",\"rating\":4.5,\"user_rating_count\":99,\"google_maps_uri\":\"https://maps.google.com/?cid=68529658709867457\",\"fetched_at\":\"2026-11-12T19:34:37+01:00\",\"reviews\":[{\"name\":\"\",\"rating\":5,\"text\":\"Très bonne friterie, le nouveau plat Crousty bowl qui est excellent, rien à dire, je recommande\",\"language_code\":\"\",\"publish_time\":\"2026-09-22T10:35:12+00:00\",\"relative_publish_time\":\"il y a un mois\",\"author\":{\"display_name\":\"Arthur\",\"uri\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108901803522394356450/reviews\",\"photo_uri\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXWJMQxt1-FG5XEmm_kFDp2-G6vaSwLBjT3sNb2rmunNCWQlAru=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\"},\"google_maps_uri\":\"\"},{\"name\":\"\",\"rating\":5,\"text\":\"Deuxième visite dans cette friterie et c’est toujours aussi bon ! Les lieux sont parfaitement tenus, on sent une hygiène irréprochable. Nous avons pris des burgers cheese bacon et burgers poulet, accompagnés de crudités bien fraîches : tout était excellent, tant les burgers que les frites. Une adresse fiable que je recommande sans hésiter.\",\"language_code\":\"\",\"publish_time\":\"2026-08-20T08:00:55+00:00\",\"relative_publish_time\":\"il y a 2 mois\",\"author\":{\"display_name\":\"Thibaut SCHOKKAERT\",\"uri\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101930453380296344495/reviews\",\"photo_uri\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLleF0T8RKTgUWl64H2JTPeCmV7HmCcsUdgXl3qb5NTTE6kQq4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\"},\"google_maps_uri\":\"\"},{\"name\":\"\",\"rating\":5,\"text\":\"Une bonne adresse à Gondecourt ! Accueil agréable, propreté irréprochable, et large choix de bons produits. Il est même possible de manger une assiette de viande de première qualité de chez Lesage (Steack bavette Aloyau, côte à l'os, viande Angus, etc.). Salle pour manger sur place. Bref, allez-y les yeux fermés !\",\"language_code\":\"\",\"publish_time\":\"2026-08-19T16:05:58+00:00\",\"relative_publish_time\":\"il y a 2 mois\",\"author\":{\"display_name\":\"Bénédicte Schokkaert\",\"uri\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117349926416004775290/reviews\",\"photo_uri\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXBGaLUKu_FP1CX1QVWPCZtXR7C6zOTv1ZlqNVahmSN61BWWWLH=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\"},\"google_maps_uri\":\"\"},{\"name\":\"\",\"rating\":1,\"text\":\"\",\"language_code\":\"\",\"publish_time\":\"2026-08-03T10:18:33+00:00\",\"relative_publish_time\":\"il y a 3 mois\",\"author\":{\"display_name\":\"Maël Duthoy\",\"uri\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103568480054065299160/reviews\",\"photo_uri\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLlMnksuRrhYxZDPh3joLXQaVBf0nTD-uWzgcvkv2Hb9w0SQg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\"},\"google_maps_uri\":\"\"},{\"name\":\"\",\"rating\":5,\"text\":\"Ambiance friterie tradi et aucune déception à la dégustation, merci Alexis !\",\"language_code\":\"\",\"publish_time\":\"2026-06-30T20:24:30+00:00\",\"relative_publish_time\":\"il y a 4 mois\",\"author\":{\"display_name\":\"noemie selin\",\"uri\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111464015296115165116/reviews\",\"photo_uri\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWHLwQGy63LBcNZ4F03_VMEcGEWxcR5qvcovkZ0tPC4EXOzgeG3=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\"},\"google_maps_uri\":\"\"}]}",
